{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest v2 COLLECTION — the WALK (collection WINNING-SPEC §4.3, "elmsnest-v2-coll-bands").

  The desire half of the page. Every product of the collection appears in exactly ONE band, and each
  band is composed differently, so the page is never one grid scrolled four times. The bands are the
  RULER's bands — measurements the shop actually holds — never an invented station taxonomy (§1
  disagreement 5, §6.8). Nothing is typed: every count, every length, every quantity, every price and
  every per-unit figure comes from snippets/elmsnest-v2-coll-axis.liquid and from product.price_min.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- how the bands are computed
  PASS 1 walks collection.products once and prints a compact row per product
  handle^unit^measured^is_area^max_number^price_min_cents^type, plus the set of handles that own a
  text-free photograph (elmsnest-v2-pdp-image, emit:'no_clean').

  The mode is then resolved from the DATA, never from the handle:
    more than one product.type   -> places   the four doors of /collections/all (§3.8.3); product.type
                                             maps 1:1 to the four collections, so it is a real field
    2+ products measured in m    -> length   decor
    2+ products measured in qty  -> count    path
    otherwise                    -> price    wall and spot, which own no shared numeric axis (§3.4)

  length / count: the measured products are sorted by their MAXIMUM reach and split into three bands
  by index, so no band is ever empty and every label is a real pair of numbers; then one band for the
  products not measured in that unit, and one for the product measured by AREA (§4.5 n-n 3 — the net
  is never drawn as a length). price: three bands by entry price. places: one band per type.

  A band with no products is never emitted. The sum of the band counts is asserted against
  collection.products_count in Liquid and printed in the last band's foot (§4.3 n-n 5).

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- the five compositions (§4.3)
    pair   two cards on a hairline, no photo band, staggered widths      small scale
    scene  a full-bleed photograph with up to two pins, the scrim card
           riding its bottom edge                                        enormous
    quote  a pull quote at 46px with one small 260px card, 3:1           tiny vs huge
    dip    an unequal photographic diptych, 1.15fr / .85fr               medium
    wide   a wide low band with the card overlaid at its start edge      wide vs short
  No band may repeat another band's composition; that is enforced in Liquid, and a composition that
  needs a photograph is never handed to a band that has none. Four equal boxes are impossible here:
  every row staggers 300 / 210 / 260 px and 1/1.05 · 1/1.4 · 1/.9 (§4.3 n-n 4, §6.3).

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- what this section reuses
    elmsnest-v2-pdp-card    the SAME card as the PDP, with the four additive params of the plumbing
                            CONTRACT §6: variant:'scene' (the scrim, used ONCE here — the scene
                            section owns the other one, §3.1), axis_caption, unit_price_line and
                            glyph:'auto' for the fifteen poster-only products.
    elmsnest-v2-coll-glyph  the sprite, rendered ONCE before any plate (CONTRACT §4, risk 11).
    elmsnest-v2-coll-axis   the parser — the single source of every number (CONTRACT §2).
  The kicker is printed on the FIRST card of the section only, never down a column (CONTRACT risk 13).

  The band's own scene photograph asks elmsnest-v2-pdp-image for the 'context' slot — this is the only
  file in the theme that does, which is why that slot's per-handle rows can be corrected without the
  PDP moving a pixel (integration, 2026-09-03).

  ---------------------------------------------------------------- no-JS / reduced motion
  Everything is markup. The cards' add-to-cart is a real POST form, the pins are plain links, and the
  bands need no scripting at all. With JS disabled the only loss is the lamp reveal: every photo, halo
  and glyph plate renders lit. Under prefers-reduced-motion the same, with transitions off.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign FS = '~~F~~'
  assign RS = '~~R~~'
  assign env2_s = section.settings
  assign env2_c = collection
  assign env2_count = env2_c.products_count | default: 0
-%}

{%- paginate env2_c.products by 50 -%}

{%- comment -%}
  PASS 1 — one row per product, and the clean-photograph set. This is the only place the axis parser
  and the image resolver are asked about every product; everything below reads these strings.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_rows = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_clean = '|' -%}
{%- assign env2_types = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_seen_t = '|' -%}
{%- assign env2_n_m = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_n_q = 0 -%}
{%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
  {%- capture env2_ax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_p -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign env2_recs = env2_ax | split: RS -%}
  {%- assign env2_u = '' -%}
  {%- assign env2_meas = '0' -%}
  {%- assign env2_area = '0' -%}
  {%- assign env2_maxn = '' -%}
  {%- if env2_recs.size > 1 -%}
    {%- assign env2_m = env2_recs[0] | split: FS -%}
    {%- assign env2_u = env2_m[3] -%}
    {%- assign env2_meas = env2_m[9] -%}
    {%- assign env2_area = env2_m[10] -%}
    {%- assign env2_maxn = env2_m[12] -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_meas == '1' and env2_u == 'm' -%}{%- assign env2_n_m = env2_n_m | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_meas == '1' and env2_u == 'qty' -%}{%- assign env2_n_q = env2_n_q | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture env2_nc -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-pdp-image', product: env2_p, emit: 'no_clean' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign env2_nc = env2_nc | strip -%}
  {%- if env2_nc == '0' -%}{%- assign env2_clean = env2_clean | append: env2_p.handle | append: '|' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_t = env2_p.type | default: '' | remove: '|' | remove: '^' | strip -%}
  {%- if env2_t != '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_tk = '|' | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
    {%- unless env2_seen_t contains env2_tk -%}
      {%- assign env2_seen_t = env2_seen_t | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
      {%- assign env2_types = env2_types | append: '~~T~~' | append: env2_t -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_pc = env2_p.price_min | default: 0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_pcx = env2_p.price_max | default: env2_pc -%}
  {%- assign env2_rows = env2_rows | append: '~~P~~' | append: env2_p.handle | append: '^' | append: env2_u | append: '^' | append: env2_meas | append: '^' | append: env2_area | append: '^' | append: env2_maxn | append: '^' | append: env2_pc | append: '^' | append: env2_pcx | append: '^' | append: env2_t -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign env2_rowlist = env2_rows | remove_first: '~~P~~' | split: '~~P~~' -%}
{%- assign env2_tlist = env2_types | remove_first: '~~T~~' | split: '~~T~~' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The order of the place bands on a catalogue page is a merchant list of product types, never a
  hard-coded taxonomy. A type the list does not name keeps its own place at the end.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_porder = section.settings.place_order | default: '' -%}
{%- if env2_porder != '' -%}
  {%- assign env2_pl = env2_porder | split: ',' -%}
  {%- assign env2_t2 = '' -%}
  {%- assign env2_tseen = '|' -%}
  {%- for env2_pt in env2_pl -%}
    {%- assign env2_pt = env2_pt | strip -%}
    {%- for env2_t in env2_tlist -%}
      {%- if env2_t == env2_pt -%}
        {%- assign env2_tk = '|' | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
        {%- unless env2_tseen contains env2_tk -%}
          {%- assign env2_tseen = env2_tseen | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
          {%- assign env2_t2 = env2_t2 | append: '~~T~~' | append: env2_t -%}
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- for env2_t in env2_tlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_tk = '|' | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
    {%- unless env2_tseen contains env2_tk -%}
      {%- assign env2_tseen = env2_tseen | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
      {%- assign env2_t2 = env2_t2 | append: '~~T~~' | append: env2_t -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_tlist = env2_t2 | remove_first: '~~T~~' | split: '~~T~~' -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%} Resolve the mode from the data, and the words the bands are labelled in. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign env2_mode = env2_s.band_mode | default: 'auto'
  if env2_mode == 'auto'
    if env2_tlist.size > 1
      assign env2_mode = 'places'
    elsif env2_n_m >= 2
      assign env2_mode = 'length'
    elsif env2_n_q >= 2
      assign env2_mode = 'count'
    else
      assign env2_mode = 'price'
    endif
  endif

  assign env2_unit = ''
  assign env2_ulabel = ''
  assign env2_cap = ''
  assign env2_offlabel = env2_s.off_label | default: ''
  if env2_mode == 'length'
    assign env2_unit = 'm'
    assign env2_ulabel = env2_s.unit_token | default: 'מ׳'
    assign env2_cap = 'לפי האורך המרבי'
    if env2_offlabel == ''
      assign env2_offlabel = 'לא נמדד במטרים'
    endif
  elsif env2_mode == 'count'
    assign env2_unit = 'qty'
    assign env2_ulabel = env2_s.unit_token | default: 'נקודות'
    assign env2_cap = 'לפי הכמות המרבית'
    if env2_offlabel == ''
      assign env2_offlabel = 'נמכרות ביחידה'
    endif
  elsif env2_mode == 'price'
    assign env2_cap = 'לפי מחיר הכניסה'
  endif
  assign env2_arealabel = env2_s.area_label | default: 'נמדדת לפי שטח'
  assign env2_restlabel = env2_s.rest_label | default: 'שאר הקולקציה'
  assign env2_perword = env2_s.per_unit_word | default: ''
  if env2_perword == '' and env2_mode == 'count'
    assign env2_perword = '₪ לנקודת אור'
  endif
  assign env2_maxbands = env2_s.max_bands | default: 5
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  STEP A — the buckets. Each band is one record: label^kind^handles^capline. A bucket that ends up
  with no product is never appended, so an empty band cannot reach the page.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_bk = '' -%}

{%- if env2_mode == 'places' -%}
  {%- assign env2_tcap = env2_maxbands -%}
  {%- if env2_tlist.size > env2_maxbands -%}
    {%- assign env2_tcap = env2_maxbands | minus: 1 -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_taken = '|' -%}
  {%- for env2_t in env2_tlist limit: env2_tcap -%}
    {%- assign env2_taken = env2_taken | append: env2_t | append: '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_hs = '|' -%}
    {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
      {%- assign env2_f = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
      {%- if env2_f[7] == env2_t -%}
        {%- assign env2_hs = env2_hs | append: env2_f[0] | append: '|' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if env2_hs != '|' -%}
      {%- assign env2_bk = env2_bk | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_t | append: '^place^' | append: env2_hs | append: '^' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_hs = '|' -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_f = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- assign env2_tk = '|' | append: env2_f[7] | append: '|' -%}
    {%- unless env2_taken contains env2_tk -%}
      {%- assign env2_hs = env2_hs | append: env2_f[0] | append: '|' -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if env2_hs != '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bk = env2_bk | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_restlabel | append: '^rest^' | append: env2_hs | append: '^' -%}
  {%- endif -%}

{%- elsif env2_mode == 'length' or env2_mode == 'count' -%}
  {%- assign env2_toks = '' -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_f = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- if env2_f[2] == '1' and env2_f[1] == env2_unit and env2_f[3] != '1' -%}
      {%- assign env2_n100 = env2_f[4] | times: 100 | round -%}
      {%- assign env2_z = 100000000 | plus: env2_n100 -%}
      {%- assign env2_zs = env2_z | append: '' | slice: 1, 8 -%}
      {%- assign env2_toks = env2_toks | append: ',' | append: env2_zs | append: '~' | append: env2_f[4] | append: '~' | append: env2_f[0] -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_sortl = env2_toks | remove_first: ',' | split: ',' | sort -%}
  {%- assign env2_mn = env2_sortl.size -%}
  {%- assign env2_cut1 = env2_mn | plus: 2 | divided_by: 3 -%}
  {%- assign env2_cut2 = env2_mn | times: 2 | plus: 2 | divided_by: 3 -%}
  {%- for env2_bi in (1..3) -%}
    {%- if env2_bi == 1 -%}
      {%- assign env2_lo = 0 -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_cut1 -%}
    {%- elsif env2_bi == 2 -%}
      {%- assign env2_lo = env2_cut1 -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_cut2 -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign env2_lo = env2_cut2 -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_mn -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- assign env2_hs = '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bmin = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bmax = '' -%}
    {%- for env2_tk in env2_sortl -%}
      {%- if forloop.index0 >= env2_lo and forloop.index0 < env2_hi -%}
        {%- assign env2_pr = env2_tk | split: '~' -%}
        {%- if env2_bmin == '' -%}{%- assign env2_bmin = env2_pr[1] -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign env2_bmax = env2_pr[1] -%}
        {%- assign env2_hs = env2_hs | append: env2_pr[2] | append: '|' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if env2_hs != '|' -%}
      {%- capture env2_lab -%}
        {%- if env2_bmin == env2_bmax -%}
          <bdi>{{ env2_bmax }}</bdi> {{ env2_ulabel }}
        {%- elsif env2_bi == 1 -%}
          עד <bdi>{{ env2_bmax }}</bdi> {{ env2_ulabel }}
        {%- elsif env2_bi == 3 -%}
          <bdi>{{ env2_bmin }}</bdi> {{ env2_ulabel }} ומעלה
        {%- else -%}
          <bdi>{{ env2_bmin }}–{{ env2_bmax }}</bdi> {{ env2_ulabel }}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign env2_lab = env2_lab | strip -%}
      {%- assign env2_bk = env2_bk | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_lab | append: '^reach^' | append: env2_hs | append: '^' | append: env2_cap -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    CREATIVE-04 — the two tail bands, built together so a one-product tail never becomes a band of its
    own. On decor the area band held exactly ONE lamp (the net) and spent a whole 1440x790 screen on a
    95px numeral, a 60px heading and one 300px card: ink density 0.9%, the weakest screen on the page.
    A band is a composition; one card is a card. When the area tail is a single lamp it joins the
    off-scale band, whose label — "not measured in metres" — is exactly as true of it, so nothing has
    to be reworded and the per-product axis caption still says 12x2 מ׳ on the card itself. Two or more
    area lamps still earn their own band. §4.3 non-negotiable 5 still holds: every product is in
    exactly one band and the sum is asserted in the foot.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign env2_areahs = '|' -%}
  {%- assign env2_arean = 0 -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_f = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- if env2_f[3] == '1' -%}
      {%- assign env2_areahs = env2_areahs | append: env2_f[0] | append: '|' -%}
      {%- assign env2_arean = env2_arean | plus: 1 -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_hs = '|' -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_f = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- unless env2_f[3] == '1' -%}
      {%- unless env2_f[2] == '1' and env2_f[1] == env2_unit -%}
        {%- assign env2_hs = env2_hs | append: env2_f[0] | append: '|' -%}
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_areamerged = false -%}
  {%- if env2_arean == 1 and env2_hs != '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_areatail = env2_areahs | remove_first: '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_hs = env2_hs | append: env2_areatail -%}
    {%- assign env2_areamerged = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_hs != '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bk = env2_bk | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_offlabel | append: '^off^' | append: env2_hs | append: '^' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_areahs != '|' and env2_areamerged == false -%}
    {%- assign env2_bk = env2_bk | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_arealabel | append: '^area^' | append: env2_areahs | append: '^' -%}
  {%- endif -%}

{%- else -%}
  {%- assign env2_toks = '' -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_f = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- assign env2_z = 100000000 | plus: env2_f[5] -%}
    {%- assign env2_zs = env2_z | append: '' | slice: 1, 8 -%}
    {%- assign env2_toks = env2_toks | append: ',' | append: env2_zs | append: '~' | append: env2_f[5] | append: '~' | append: env2_f[0] -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_sortl = env2_toks | remove_first: ',' | split: ',' | sort -%}
  {%- assign env2_mn = env2_sortl.size -%}
  {%- assign env2_cut1 = env2_mn | plus: 2 | divided_by: 3 -%}
  {%- assign env2_cut2 = env2_mn | times: 2 | plus: 2 | divided_by: 3 -%}
  {%- for env2_bi in (1..3) -%}
    {%- if env2_bi == 1 -%}
      {%- assign env2_lo = 0 -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_cut1 -%}
    {%- elsif env2_bi == 2 -%}
      {%- assign env2_lo = env2_cut1 -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_cut2 -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign env2_lo = env2_cut2 -%}{%- assign env2_hi = env2_mn -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- assign env2_hs = '|' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bmin = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bmax = '' -%}
    {%- for env2_tk in env2_sortl -%}
      {%- if forloop.index0 >= env2_lo and forloop.index0 < env2_hi -%}
        {%- assign env2_pr = env2_tk | split: '~' -%}
        {%- if env2_bmin == '' -%}{%- assign env2_bmin = env2_pr[1] -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign env2_bmax = env2_pr[1] -%}
        {%- assign env2_hs = env2_hs | append: env2_pr[2] | append: '|' -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if env2_hs != '|' -%}
      {%- capture env2_lab -%}
        {%- if env2_bmin == env2_bmax -%}
          <bdi>{{ env2_bmin | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪
        {%- elsif env2_bi == 1 -%}
          עד <bdi>{{ env2_bmax | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪
        {%- elsif env2_bi == 3 -%}
          מ־<bdi>{{ env2_bmin | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪ ומעלה
        {%- else -%}
          <bdi>{{ env2_bmin | money_without_currency }}–{{ env2_bmax | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign env2_lab = env2_lab | strip -%}
      {%- assign env2_bk = env2_bk | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_lab | append: '^price^' | append: env2_hs | append: '^' | append: env2_cap -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
  STEP B — per band: the count, the price span, whether it owns a photograph, and its composition.
  A composition is used at most once on the page, and scene and wide are only handed to a band that
  has a text-free photograph to carry them.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_blist = env2_bk | remove_first: '~~B~~' | split: '~~B~~' -%}
{%- comment -%}
  CREATIVE-02 — the pull quote is a HUMAN sentence or there is no pull quote. It used to fall back to
  a sentence assembled from the band's own min and max ("2 דגמים בפס הזה, מ־149.90 ₪ ועד 999.90 ₪."),
  set at 46px serif inside the only filled box on the page, restating the band header and the card
  beside it — arithmetic in the one place reserved for a voice. The generated sentence is gone. The
  quote composition is now only in the rotation when a line exists to set in it: a band block's own
  quote, the section's, or §4.3's authored line for the collection it was written for. Where there is
  none the band takes another composition, and no band ever repeats another's (non-negotiable 1).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_quotecopy = env2_s.quote | default: '' -%}
{%- capture env2_rph -%}{ratio}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if env2_quotecopy == '' -%}
  {%- if collection.handle == 'גרילנדות-ותאורה-דקורטיבית' -%}
    {%- assign env2_quotecopy = 'עשר נורות שמתנדנדות ברוח, ובוקעות מתוך הפרחים.' -%}
  {%- elsif collection.handle == 'תאורת-שביל-סולארית' -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      §4.3's second authored quote, with its one number DERIVED rather than typed (§6.19). The
      sentence is the spec's; the ratio is this collection's own price_max over its price_min, the
      same figure §4.4's ladder deck prints two screens below, so the two can never disagree and
      neither can go stale when a price changes. If the ratio ever falls under two the sentence
      stops being true and the band simply does not draw a quote.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- capture env2_quotecopy -%}בין המנורה הזולה ליקרה יש פי {ratio}. ההבדל הוא כמה מנורות מקבלים.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if env2_quotecopy contains env2_rph -%}
  {%- assign env2_qlo = 0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_qhi = 0 -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_g = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- assign env2_c1 = env2_g[5] | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_c2 = env2_g[6] | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- if env2_qlo == 0 or env2_c1 < env2_qlo -%}{%- assign env2_qlo = env2_c1 -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if env2_c2 > env2_qhi -%}{%- assign env2_qhi = env2_c2 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_qratio = 0 -%}
  {%- if env2_qlo > 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_qratio = env2_qhi | times: 1.0 | divided_by: env2_qlo | round -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_qratio >= 2 -%}
    {%- capture env2_qrs -%}<bdi>{{ env2_qratio }}</bdi>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign env2_quotecopy = env2_quotecopy | replace: env2_rph, env2_qrs -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign env2_quotecopy = '' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign env2_anyquote = false -%}
{%- if env2_quotecopy != '' -%}{%- assign env2_anyquote = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- for env2_qb in section.blocks -%}
  {%- if env2_qb.settings.quote != blank -%}{%- assign env2_anyquote = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if env2_anyquote -%}
  {%- assign env2_order = 'pair,scene,quote,dip,wide' | split: ',' -%}
  {%- assign env2_free = 'pair,quote,dip' | split: ',' -%}
  {%- assign env2_nfree0 = 3 -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- assign env2_order = 'pair,scene,dip,wide' | split: ',' -%}
  {%- assign env2_free = 'pair,dip' | split: ',' -%}
  {%- assign env2_nfree0 = 2 -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign env2_shot = 'scene,wide' | split: ',' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Which bands own a text-free photograph, and how many do not. A composition that needs a photograph
  is never handed to a band without one, and the count below keeps the greedy choice from spending
  the three photo-less compositions on photo bands and stranding the last band with a scene it cannot
  draw. That is the only reason this pre-pass exists.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign env2_pf = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_npl = 0 -%}
{%- for env2_b in env2_blist -%}
  {%- if forloop.index > env2_maxbands -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_f = env2_b | split: '^' -%}
  {%- assign env2_hs = env2_f[2] -%}
  {%- assign env2_ph = '0' -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_g = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- assign env2_hk = '|' | append: env2_g[0] | append: '|' -%}
    {%- if env2_hs contains env2_hk -%}
      {%- if env2_clean contains env2_hk -%}{%- assign env2_ph = '1' -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if section.blocks.size > forloop.index0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_wblk = section.blocks[forloop.index0] -%}
    {%- if env2_wblk.settings.scene_image -%}{%- assign env2_ph = '1' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_ph == '0' -%}{%- assign env2_npl = env2_npl | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_pf = env2_pf | append: env2_ph -%}
{%- endfor -%}

{%- assign env2_used = '|' -%}
{%- assign env2_bands = '' -%}
{%- assign env2_sum = 0 -%}
{%- assign env2_nfree = env2_nfree0 -%}
{%- assign env2_pldone = 0 -%}
{%- for env2_b in env2_blist -%}
  {%- if forloop.index > env2_maxbands -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_bi0 = forloop.index0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_f = env2_b | split: '^' -%}
  {%- assign env2_hs = env2_f[2] -%}
  {%- assign env2_photo = env2_pf | slice: env2_bi0, 1 -%}
  {%- assign env2_n = 0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_min = 0 -%}
  {%- assign env2_max = 0 -%}
  {%- for env2_r in env2_rowlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_g = env2_r | split: '^' -%}
    {%- assign env2_hk = '|' | append: env2_g[0] | append: '|' -%}
    {%- if env2_hs contains env2_hk -%}
      {%- assign env2_n = env2_n | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- assign env2_cents = env2_g[5] | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_centx = env2_g[6] | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- if env2_min == 0 -%}{%- assign env2_min = env2_cents -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_cents < env2_min -%}{%- assign env2_min = env2_cents -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_centx > env2_max -%}{%- assign env2_max = env2_centx -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_sum = env2_sum | plus: env2_n -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    The composition. A merchant choice wins when it is free and drawable; otherwise the band takes its
    place in the default rhythm; otherwise the first composition that is still free and drawable. No
    composition is ever used twice, which is non-negotiable 1 of this section.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign env2_want = '' -%}
  {%- if section.blocks.size > env2_bi0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_wblk = section.blocks[env2_bi0] -%}
    {%- assign env2_want = env2_wblk.settings.composition | default: '' -%}
    {%- if env2_want == 'auto' -%}{%- assign env2_want = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if env2_want == '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_want = env2_order[env2_bi0] | default: 'pair' -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- assign env2_pool = env2_order -%}
  {%- if env2_photo == '0' -%}
    {%- assign env2_pool = env2_free -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign env2_pleft = env2_npl | minus: env2_pldone -%}
    {%- if env2_pleft >= env2_nfree -%}{%- assign env2_pool = env2_shot -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- assign env2_okwant = false -%}
  {%- for env2_o in env2_pool -%}
    {%- if env2_o == env2_want -%}{%- assign env2_okwant = true -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign env2_wk = '|' | append: env2_want | append: '|' -%}
  {%- if env2_used contains env2_wk -%}{%- assign env2_okwant = false -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- unless env2_okwant -%}
    {%- assign env2_want = '' -%}
    {%- for env2_o in env2_pool -%}
      {%- assign env2_ok = '|' | append: env2_o | append: '|' -%}
      {%- unless env2_used contains env2_ok -%}
        {%- assign env2_want = env2_o -%}
        {%- break -%}
      {%- endunless -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if env2_want == '' -%}
      {%- for env2_o in env2_order -%}
        {%- assign env2_ok = '|' | append: env2_o | append: '|' -%}
        {%- unless env2_used contains env2_ok -%}
          {%- assign env2_want = env2_o -%}
          {%- break -%}
        {%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if env2_want == '' -%}{%- assign env2_want = 'pair' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
  {%- assign env2_used = env2_used | append: env2_want | append: '|' -%}
  {%- unless env2_want == 'scene' or env2_want == 'wide' -%}
    {%- assign env2_nfree = env2_nfree | minus: 1 -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
  {%- if env2_photo == '0' -%}{%- assign env2_pldone = env2_pldone | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign env2_cap2 = env2_f[3] | default: '' -%}
  {%- assign env2_bands = env2_bands | append: '~~B~~' | append: env2_f[0] | append: '^' | append: env2_f[1] | append: '^' | append: env2_hs | append: '^' | append: env2_cap2 | append: '^' | append: env2_want | append: '^' | append: env2_n | append: '^' | append: env2_min | append: '^' | append: env2_max | append: '^' | append: env2_photo -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign env2_bandlist = env2_bands | remove_first: '~~B~~' | split: '~~B~~' -%}

{%- assign env2_kicked = false -%}

<section id="env2-coll-bands" data-env2-coll-bands class="env2-section env2-coll env2-coll-bands" dir="rtl" style="scroll-margin-top:90px;--env2-stars:.34" aria-label="{{ env2_s.eyebrow | default: 'תחנות הערב' | escape }}">
  <div class="env2-stars" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  {%- comment -%} the glyph sprite, ONCE, before any plate can be drawn (CONTRACT §4, risk 11) {%- endcomment -%}
  {% render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-glyph', sprite: true %}
  {% render 'elmsnest-v2-pdp-card', css: true %}

  {%- if env2_s.eyebrow != blank or env2_s.deck != blank -%}
    <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__head">
      {%- if env2_s.eyebrow != blank -%}<p class="env2-eyebrow env2-coll-bands__eyebrow">{{ env2_s.eyebrow }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_s.deck != blank -%}<p class="env2-lead env2-coll-bands__deck">{{ env2_s.deck }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- for env2_b in env2_bandlist -%}
    {%- assign env2_f = env2_b | split: '^' -%}
    {%- assign env2_label = env2_f[0] -%}
    {%- assign env2_kind = env2_f[1] -%}
    {%- assign env2_hs = env2_f[2] -%}
    {%- assign env2_capline = env2_f[3] | default: '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_comp = env2_f[4] -%}
    {%- assign env2_n = env2_f[5] | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_min = env2_f[6] | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_max = env2_f[7] | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_num = forloop.index -%}
    {%- assign env2_last = forloop.last -%}
    {%- assign env2_bi0 = forloop.index0 -%}

    {%- comment -%} the optional per-band block: copy and pickers only, never the membership {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign env2_hasblk = false -%}
    {%- assign env2_blabel = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bquote = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bimg = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_bidx = 0 -%}
    {%- assign env2_baction = '' -%}
    {%- assign env2_bpin1 = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_bpin2 = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_bx1 = 38 -%}
    {%- assign env2_by1 = 30 -%}
    {%- assign env2_bx2 = 68 -%}
    {%- assign env2_by2 = 52 -%}
    {%- assign env2_bpicks = '|' -%}
    {%- if section.blocks.size > env2_bi0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_blk = section.blocks[env2_bi0] -%}
      {%- assign env2_hasblk = true -%}
      {%- assign env2_blabel = env2_blk.settings.label | default: '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_bquote = env2_blk.settings.quote | default: '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_bimg = env2_blk.settings.scene_image -%}
      {%- assign env2_bidx = env2_blk.settings.card_image_index | default: 0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_baction = env2_blk.settings.card_action_label | default: '' -%}
      {%- assign env2_bpin1 = env2_blk.settings.pin_1_product -%}
      {%- assign env2_bpin2 = env2_blk.settings.pin_2_product -%}
      {%- assign env2_bx1 = env2_blk.settings.pin_1_x | default: 38 -%}
      {%- assign env2_by1 = env2_blk.settings.pin_1_y | default: 30 -%}
      {%- assign env2_bx2 = env2_blk.settings.pin_2_x | default: 68 -%}
      {%- assign env2_by2 = env2_blk.settings.pin_2_y | default: 52 -%}
      {%- for env2_i in (1..3) -%}
        {%- if env2_i == 1 -%}{%- assign env2_pk = env2_blk.settings.product_1 -%}
        {%- elsif env2_i == 2 -%}{%- assign env2_pk = env2_blk.settings.product_2 -%}
        {%- else -%}{%- assign env2_pk = env2_blk.settings.product_3 -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_pk -%}
          {%- assign env2_pkh = '|' | append: env2_pk.handle | append: '|' -%}
          {%- if env2_hs contains env2_pkh -%}{%- assign env2_bpicks = env2_bpicks | append: env2_pk.handle | append: '|' -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if env2_blabel != '' -%}{%- assign env2_label = env2_blabel -%}{%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      The band's own pin products and its photograph: the first two members, and the first member that
      owns a text-free frame. A merchant picker wins over both. No object survives into the next band.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign env2_pin1 = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_pin2 = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_photop = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_p1on = false -%}
    {%- assign env2_p2on = false -%}
    {%- assign env2_phon = false -%}
    {%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
      {%- assign env2_hk = '|' | append: env2_p.handle | append: '|' -%}
      {%- if env2_hs contains env2_hk -%}
        {%- if env2_p1on == false -%}
          {%- assign env2_pin1 = env2_p -%}{%- assign env2_p1on = true -%}
        {%- elsif env2_p2on == false -%}
          {%- assign env2_pin2 = env2_p -%}{%- assign env2_p2on = true -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if env2_phon == false and env2_clean contains env2_hk -%}
          {%- assign env2_photop = env2_p -%}{%- assign env2_phon = true -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if env2_bpin1 -%}{%- assign env2_pin1 = env2_bpin1 -%}{%- assign env2_p1on = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if env2_bpin2 -%}{%- assign env2_pin2 = env2_bpin2 -%}{%- assign env2_p2on = true -%}{%- endif -%}

    {%- assign env2_photosrc = nil -%}
    {%- assign env2_photoalt = '' -%}
    {%- if env2_bimg -%}
      {%- assign env2_photosrc = env2_bimg -%}
      {%- assign env2_photoalt = env2_bimg.alt | default: env2_label | strip_html -%}
    {%- elsif env2_phon -%}
      {%- capture env2_pi -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-pdp-image', product: env2_photop, slot: 'context' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
      {%- assign env2_pi = env2_pi | strip | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- assign env2_photosrc = env2_photop.images[env2_pi] -%}
      {%- assign env2_photoalt = env2_photop.title -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- unless env2_photosrc -%}
      {%- if env2_comp == 'scene' -%}{%- assign env2_comp = 'pair' -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- if env2_comp == 'wide' -%}{%- assign env2_comp = 'pair' -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- comment -%} the pull quote: this band's authored line, or the collection's — never a derived one {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign env2_quote = env2_bquote -%}
    {%- if env2_quote == '' -%}{%- assign env2_quote = env2_quotecopy -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if env2_comp == 'quote' and env2_quote == '' -%}{%- assign env2_comp = 'pair' -%}{%- endif -%}

    <article class="env2-coll-bands__band env2-coll-bands__band--{{ env2_comp }}" id="env2-band-{{ env2_num }}" data-kind="{{ env2_kind }}" data-cards="{{ env2_n }}"{% if env2_hasblk %} {{ env2_blk.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}>
      <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__bandhead">
        <p class="env2-coll-bands__num" aria-hidden="true"><bdi>{% if env2_num < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ env2_num }}</bdi></p>
        <div class="env2-coll-bands__bandtitle">
          <h2 class="env2-h env2-coll-bands__h2">{{ env2_label }}</h2>
          <p class="env2-coll-bands__facts">
            {%- if env2_n == 1 -%}מנורה אחת{%- else -%}<bdi>{{ env2_n }}</bdi> מנורות{% endif %} · מ־<bdi>{{ env2_min | money_without_currency }}</bdi> ₪
            {%- if env2_capline != '' %} · {{ env2_capline }}{% endif -%}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- if env2_comp == 'quote' -%}
        <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__body env2-coll-bands__body--quote">
          <blockquote class="env2-coll-bands__quote">{{ env2_quote }}</blockquote>
      {%- elsif env2_comp == 'scene' -%}
        <div class="env2-coll-bands__body env2-coll-bands__body--scene">
          <figure class="env2-coll-bands__fig env2-coll-bands__fig--scene" data-lamp>
            <picture>
              <source media="(max-width:900px)" srcset="{{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 1000 }}">
              <img src="{{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 1800 }}"
                   srcset="{{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 1400 }} 1400w, {{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 1800 }} 1800w"
                   sizes="100vw" alt="{{ env2_photoalt | escape }}" width="1800" height="1013"
                   {% if env2_num == 1 %}loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"{% else %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>
            </picture>
            <span class="env2-coll-bands__tint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="env2-coll-bands__veil" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            {%- if env2_s.show_pins != false -%}
              {%- for env2_i in (1..2) -%}
                {%- if env2_i == 1 -%}
                  {%- assign env2_pp = env2_pin1 -%}{%- assign env2_pon = env2_p1on -%}
                  {%- assign env2_px = env2_bx1 -%}{%- assign env2_py = env2_by1 -%}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- assign env2_pp = env2_pin2 -%}{%- assign env2_pon = env2_p2on -%}
                  {%- assign env2_px = env2_bx2 -%}{%- assign env2_py = env2_by2 -%}
                {%- endif -%}
                {%- if env2_pon -%}
                  {%- capture env2_pax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_pp -%}{%- endcapture -%}
                  {%- assign env2_prc = env2_pax | split: RS -%}
                  {%- assign env2_pval = '' -%}
                  {%- if env2_prc.size > 1 -%}
                    {%- assign env2_pst = env2_prc[1] | split: FS -%}
                    {%- assign env2_pval = env2_pst[2] -%}
                    {%- if env2_pval == 'Default Title' -%}{%- assign env2_pval = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <a class="env2-coll-bands__pin" href="{{ env2_pp.url }}" style="--env2-pin-x:{{ env2_px }}%;--env2-pin-y:{{ env2_py }}%;--env2-pin-stem:{{ env2_s.pin_stem | default: 110 }}px">
                    <span class="env2-coll-bands__pindot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="env2-coll-bands__pinstem" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="env2-coll-bands__pintag">
                      {%- comment -%}
                        CREATIVE-08 / QA-02 — the tag names the lamp in the words the shop opens with,
                        not its whole SEO title. At 13px inside a 42vw tag a 54-character title still
                        did not fit two lines on a phone (measured: clipped on 8 of 10 tags at 390 and
                        10 of 10 at 320), and a name cut mid-word is not real data (§4.1 n-n 4). Three
                        words is the same rule the scene's own tag has always used, so the two pins on
                        the page now say the same kind of thing.
                      {%- endcomment -%}
                      {%- assign env2_pnm = env2_pp.title | split: '–' | first | split: ' - ' | first | strip | truncatewords: 3, '' -%}
                      <b class="env2-coll-bands__pinname">{{ env2_pnm }}</b>
                      {%- if env2_pval != '' -%}<i class="env2-coll-bands__pinval">{{ env2_pval }}</i>{%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  </a>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          </figure>
      {%- elsif env2_comp == 'wide' -%}
        <div class="env2-coll-bands__body env2-coll-bands__body--wide">
          <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__widegrid">
            <figure class="env2-coll-bands__fig env2-coll-bands__fig--wide" data-lamp>
              <img src="{{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
                   srcset="{{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ env2_photosrc | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w"
                   sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 76vw" alt="{{ env2_photoalt | escape }}"
                   width="1600" height="686" loading="lazy">
              <span class="env2-coll-bands__tint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="env2-coll-bands__edge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </figure>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__body env2-coll-bands__body--{{ env2_comp }}">
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        The cards. One flow, one loop; the composition is CSS. The first card of a scene band is the
        scrim card (variant:'scene') and it is the ONLY one on this page — the scene section owns the
        other of the two the ground allows (§3.1, CONTRACT risk 10). Products a merchant picked are
        rendered first; membership itself is computed, never picked, so the exactly-once rule holds.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="env2-coll-bands__cards env2-coll-bands__cards--{{ env2_comp }}">
        {%- assign env2_ci = 0 -%}
        {%- for env2_pass in (1..2) -%}
          {%- for env2_p in env2_c.products -%}
            {%- assign env2_hk = '|' | append: env2_p.handle | append: '|' -%}
            {%- unless env2_hs contains env2_hk -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endunless -%}
            {%- assign env2_ispick = false -%}
            {%- if env2_bpicks contains env2_hk -%}{%- assign env2_ispick = true -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if env2_pass == 1 and env2_ispick == false -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if env2_pass == 2 and env2_ispick -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}

            {%- capture env2_cax -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-coll-axis', product: env2_p, per_unit_word: env2_perword -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            {%- assign env2_crecs = env2_cax | split: RS -%}
            {%- assign env2_caxis = '' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cunit = '' -%}
            {%- assign env2_cact = '' -%}
            {%- if env2_crecs.size > 1 -%}
              {%- assign env2_cm = env2_crecs[0] | split: FS -%}
              {%- assign env2_cfirst = env2_crecs[1] | split: FS -%}
              {%- assign env2_clasti = env2_crecs.size | minus: 1 -%}
              {%- assign env2_clast = env2_crecs[env2_clasti] | split: FS -%}
              {%- assign env2_v1 = env2_cfirst[2] -%}
              {%- assign env2_v2 = env2_clast[2] -%}
              {%- if env2_v1 != 'Default Title' -%}
                {%- if env2_clasti > 1 and env2_v2 != env2_v1 -%}
                  {%- capture env2_caxis -%}{{ env2_v1 }} · {{ env2_v2 }}{%- endcapture -%}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- assign env2_caxis = env2_v1 -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                the derived per-unit figure, at the CHEAPEST value on the axis, so it belongs to the
                same variant the card's own price rule prints. The snippet does the arithmetic and the
                caller prefixes the tilde INSIDE the bdi (CONTRACT §3.5 rule 1).
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if env2_s.show_unit_price != false -%}
                {%- assign env2_bestc = 0 -%}
                {%- assign env2_bestu = '' -%}
                {%- assign env2_bestl = '' -%}
                {%- for env2_rec in env2_crecs offset: 1 -%}
                  {%- assign env2_st = env2_rec | split: FS -%}
                  {%- assign env2_pu = env2_st[13] | default: '' -%}
                  {%- if env2_pu != '' -%}
                    {%- assign env2_cc = env2_st[11] | plus: 0 -%}
                    {%- if env2_bestc == 0 or env2_cc < env2_bestc -%}
                      {%- assign env2_bestc = env2_cc -%}
                      {%- assign env2_bestu = env2_pu -%}
                      {%- assign env2_bestl = env2_st[14] -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
                {%- if env2_bestu != '' -%}
                  {%- capture env2_cunit -%}<bdi>≈{{ env2_bestu }}</bdi> {{ env2_bestl }}{%- endcapture -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if env2_cm[3] == 'm' -%}
                {%- assign env2_cact = 'לבחירת אורך' -%}
              {%- elsif env2_cm[3] == 'qty' -%}
                {%- assign env2_cact = 'לבחירת כמות' -%}
              {%- elsif env2_cm[2] contains 'צבע' or env2_cm[2] contains 'גוון' -%}
                {%- assign env2_cact = 'לבחירת גוון' -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- assign env2_cact = 'לבחירת דגם' -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if env2_baction != '' -%}{%- assign env2_cact = env2_baction -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if env2_s.action_label != blank -%}{%- assign env2_cact = env2_s.action_label -%}{%- endif -%}

            {%- assign env2_mod = env2_ci | modulo: 3 -%}
            {%- assign env2_cw = 300 -%}
            {%- assign env2_car = '1/1.05' -%}
            {%- if env2_mod == 1 -%}
              {%- assign env2_cw = 210 -%}{%- assign env2_car = '1/1.4' -%}
            {%- elsif env2_mod == 2 -%}
              {%- assign env2_cw = 260 -%}{%- assign env2_car = '1/.9' -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign env2_cvar = '' -%}
            {%- if env2_comp == 'scene' and env2_ci == 0 -%}
              {%- assign env2_cvar = 'scene' -%}{%- assign env2_cw = 400 -%}{%- assign env2_car = '1/.9' -%}
            {%- elsif env2_comp == 'quote' and env2_ci == 0 -%}
              {%- assign env2_cw = 260 -%}{%- assign env2_car = '1/1.4' -%}
            {%- elsif env2_comp == 'wide' and env2_ci == 0 -%}
              {%- assign env2_cw = 320 -%}{%- assign env2_car = '1/1.05' -%}
            {%- elsif env2_comp == 'dip' -%}
              {%- assign env2_car = '1/1.05' -%}
              {%- assign env2_mod2 = env2_ci | modulo: 2 -%}
              {%- if env2_mod2 == 1 -%}{%- assign env2_car = '1/1.4' -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign env2_ck = 'none' -%}
            {%- if env2_kicked == false and env2_s.show_kicker != false -%}
              {%- assign env2_ck = '' -%}
              {%- assign env2_kicked = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            <div class="env2-coll-bands__cell">
              {% render 'elmsnest-v2-pdp-card', product: env2_p, width: env2_cw, aspect: env2_car,
                       image_index: env2_bidx, kicker: env2_ck, action_label: env2_cact,
                       axis_caption: env2_caxis, unit_price_line: env2_cunit,
                       variant: env2_cvar, glyph: 'auto' %}
            </div>
            {%- assign env2_ci = env2_ci | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- if env2_comp == 'wide' -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- if env2_last and env2_s.show_assert != false -%}
        <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__foot">
          <p class="env2-coll-bands__assert">
            {%- if env2_sum == env2_count -%}
              <bdi>{{ env2_sum }}</bdi> מנורות {% if env2_bandlist.size == 1 %}בפס אחד{% else %}ב־<bdi>{{ env2_bandlist.size }}</bdi> פסים{% endif %} — כל מנורה בקולקציה מופיעה בפס אחד בדיוק.
            {%- else -%}
              <bdi>{{ env2_sum }}</bdi> מתוך <bdi>{{ env2_count }}</bdi> המנורות בקולקציה מופיעות בפסים שלמעלה.
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
          {%- if env2_s.foot_note != blank -%}<p class="env2-coll-bands__footnote">{{ env2_s.foot_note }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </article>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- if env2_bandlist.size == 0 -%}
    <div class="env2-wrap env2-coll-bands__foot">
      <p class="env2-coll-bands__assert">אין מוצרים להצגה בקולקציה הזאת.</p>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</section>
{%- endpaginate -%}

{% stylesheet %}
/* ElmsNest v2 collection — §4.3 the walk. Five compositions, no grid, radius 0, logical properties
   only. Nothing here paints a page background: the ground is elmsnest-v2-ground-collection, rendered
   once by the scene section (§3.1). Shared classes are only SIZED from these selectors, never
   restyled (plumbing CONTRACT §0). */
/* CREATIVE-04 — measured per 900px screen against the approved pages (homepage median 28.9% ink,
   PDP 12.6%), this page ran long strings of 2–4% screens, and a good part of that was ground BETWEEN
   things: 216px at every section boundary and up to 132px between bands, on a page whose bands are
   already tall. The vertical spend is cut roughly a third here and in the four sections below; no
   composition changes and nothing is removed but ground. */
.env2-coll-bands{padding-block:clamp(56px,6vw,84px) clamp(40px,4.6vw,64px);position:relative}
.env2-coll-bands__head{margin-block-end:clamp(28px,3vw,48px)}
.env2-coll-bands__deck{margin-block:14px 0}

.env2-coll-bands__band{position:relative;margin-block-end:clamp(48px,5.4vw,88px)}
.env2-coll-bands__band:last-child{margin-block-end:0}
.env2-coll-bands__bandhead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr);align-items:baseline;
  gap:clamp(16px,2vw,32px);padding-block-start:clamp(20px,2.4vw,34px);
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair);margin-block-end:clamp(22px,2.6vw,40px)}
.env2-coll-bands__num{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:900;line-height:.9;
  font-size:clamp(56px,6.6vw,96px);color:var(--env2-gold);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
  letter-spacing:-.02em}
.env2-coll-bands__bandtitle{min-inline-size:0}
.env2-coll-bands__h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,60px);line-height:1}
.env2-coll-bands__facts{margin-block:12px 0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;
  font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--env2-ink-2)}

/* ---- the cards row: never four equal cells (§4.3 n-n 4) ---- */
.env2-coll-bands__cards{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;
  gap:clamp(20px,2.6vw,44px) clamp(18px,2.4vw,40px)}
.env2-coll-bands__cell{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;min-inline-size:0}
.env2-coll-bands__cards .env2-pdp-card__axis,
.env2-coll-bands__cards .env2-pdp-card__unit{font-size:14px}
/* §6.13 — the card title is a real link and a real tap target. One line of the title is 19px and two are
   39px, both under the 44px floor, so the hit area is expanded with padding the negative margin gives
   back; this is the same device .env2-coll-scene__card already uses on its own title. Measured at 390:
   19/39px -> 44px, with no change to the band's vertical rhythm. */
.env2-coll-bands__cards .env2-pdp-card__title a{display:inline-block;padding-block:12px;margin-block:-12px}

/* 01 pair — cards on a hairline, the quiet opening. Three unequal columns, never four in a row and
   never equal cells (§6.3): the card keeps its own staggered width inside its column. */
.env2-coll-bands__body--pair .env2-coll-bands__cards{padding-block-start:clamp(18px,2vw,30px);
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-bands__cards--pair,.env2-coll-bands__cards--scene{display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.12fr) minmax(0,.82fr) minmax(0,1.06fr);
  align-items:end;justify-items:start}

/* 02 scene — a full-bleed photograph, up to two pins, the scrim card riding the bottom edge */
.env2-coll-bands__body--scene{position:relative}
.env2-coll-bands__fig{position:relative;margin:0;display:block;overflow:hidden;border-radius:0}
.env2-coll-bands__fig--scene{inline-size:100%;block-size:min(62svh,620px)}
.env2-coll-bands__fig img{inline-size:100%;block-size:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 46%;
  display:block;border-radius:0;filter:brightness(calc(.26 + .42*var(--lit,1))) saturate(.9);
  transition:filter 1.6s cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1)}
/* §3.6.4 — the multiply veil that keeps a bright interior (the birch) off the night page. It is on
   every figure, not only that one, because a merchant image can be anything. */
.env2-coll-bands__tint{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--env2-sky-4);
  mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.46;pointer-events:none}
.env2-coll-bands__veil{position:absolute;inset-inline:0;inset-block-end:0;block-size:56%;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,3,6,0) 0%,rgba(4,7,14,.72) 58%,rgba(2,3,6,.96) 100%);
  pointer-events:none}
.env2-coll-bands__body--scene .env2-coll-bands__cards{position:relative;z-index:2;
  margin-block-start:min(-120px,-8vw);
  inline-size:min(var(--env2-w,1240px),100% - 2*var(--env2-gut));margin-inline:auto}
.env2-coll-bands__cards--scene .env2-coll-bands__cell:first-child{grid-column:3;justify-self:end}
.env2-coll-bands__body--scene .env2-pdp-card--scene{--env2-pdp-card-w:400px}

/* the pin — dot, hairline stem, gold tag; the tag prints the lamp and its own real value (C10) */
/* the pin box has NO width, so the dot sits exactly on the merchant's per-cent and the tag hangs
   symmetrically under it; the position is clamped and the tag capped so a tag can never be cut by
   the figure's inline edge. */
.env2-coll-bands__pin{position:absolute;inset-inline-start:clamp(11%,var(--env2-pin-x,38%),89%);
  inset-block-start:var(--env2-pin-y,30%);z-index:3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;inline-size:0;text-decoration:none;color:var(--env2-ink)}
.env2-coll-bands__pindot{inline-size:9px;block-size:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--env2-glow);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,211,148,.16),0 0 34px 10px rgba(255,211,148,.30);
  opacity:var(--lit,1);transition:opacity .5s ease}
.env2-coll-bands__pinstem{inline-size:1px;block-size:var(--env2-pin-stem,110px);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,211,148,.75),rgba(244,238,227,.22));
  transform-origin:50% 0;transform:scaleY(var(--lit,1));
  transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) .15s}
/* the pin box is zero-width, so a tag that is allowed to WRAP shrinks to min-content inside it — the
   two-line name of QA-02 came out about 70px wide and clipped. max-content restores the intent: the
   tag is as wide as its own line, capped by the room the figure has. */
.env2-coll-bands__pintag{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;justify-content:center;
  min-block-size:44px;padding-inline:14px;padding-block:9px;background:rgba(5,8,14,.55);
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-radius:0;opacity:var(--lit,1);
  transition:opacity .4s ease .25s;inline-size:max-content;max-inline-size:26vw}
/* QA-02 + TYPOGRAPHER-03 — the pin's label is the lamp's own NAME: data, not a tracked kicker. It
   was set at 11px (§6 rule 13's floor is 13) and clipped by 20ch + ellipsis to about a third of
   itself ('מנורת שביל סו…'), i.e. a link target that did not say what it linked to. 13px Heebo 400,
   two lines on the scrim it already has, no ellipsis. */
.env2-coll-bands__pinname{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;
  color:var(--env2-gold);max-inline-size:28ch;overflow:hidden;white-space:normal;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.02em;line-height:1.35}
.env2-coll-bands__pinval{display:block;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;
  font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--env2-ink);white-space:nowrap}
.env2-coll-bands__pin:hover .env2-coll-bands__pinname{color:var(--env2-glow)}
/* QA-04 — the anchor is 0 x 137 (its children are the box), so the ring painted a 2px hairline
   beside the tag instead of round it. */
.env2-coll-bands__pin:focus-visible{outline:none}
.env2-coll-bands__pin:focus-visible .env2-coll-bands__pintag{outline:2px solid var(--env2-glow);outline-offset:3px}

/* 03 quote — a pull quote at 46px beside one small card, 3:1 */
.env2-coll-bands__body--quote{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,3fr);
  gap:clamp(24px,3vw,52px);align-items:center}
/* CREATIVE-02 — Kalles paints <blockquote> as a filled panel with a decorative quote mark, and it
   came through as the only opaque rectangle on the page (§6.14: the scrim is the only card surface).
   The quote is type on the night, with one gold hairline on the start edge and nothing else. */
.env2-coll-bands__quote{grid-column:2;margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-serif);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,46px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--env2-ink);
  text-wrap:balance;max-inline-size:22ch;
  background:none;box-shadow:none;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:0;
  border-inline-start:1px solid var(--env2-gold);padding-inline-start:clamp(18px,2vw,32px)}
.env2-coll-bands__quote::before,.env2-coll-bands__quote::after{content:none;display:none}
.env2-coll-bands__quote p{margin:0}
.env2-coll-bands__cards--quote{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}

/* 04 dip — an unequal photographic diptych, never two equal squares */
.env2-coll-bands__cards--dip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;
  gap:clamp(20px,2.6vw,44px);align-items:end}
.env2-coll-bands__cards--dip .env2-coll-bands__cell{inline-size:100%}
.env2-coll-bands__cards--dip .env2-pdp-card{inline-size:100%}
.env2-coll-bands__band[data-cards="1"] .env2-coll-bands__cards--dip{grid-template-columns:auto minmax(0,1fr)}
.env2-coll-bands__band[data-cards="1"] .env2-coll-bands__cards--dip .env2-pdp-card{inline-size:var(--env2-pdp-card-w,280px)}

/* 05 wide — a wide low band with the card overlaid at its start edge */
.env2-coll-bands__widegrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center}
.env2-coll-bands__fig--wide{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;inline-size:100%;
  block-size:clamp(190px,20vw,280px)}
.env2-coll-bands__fig--wide img{object-position:50% 50%}
.env2-coll-bands__edge{position:absolute;inset-block:0;inset-inline-start:0;inline-size:74%;
  background:linear-gradient(270deg,rgba(2,3,6,.97) 0%,rgba(4,7,14,.82) 46%,rgba(2,3,6,0) 100%);
  pointer-events:none}
.env2-coll-bands__cards--wide{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;align-self:center;position:relative;z-index:2;
  max-inline-size:72%;padding-inline-start:clamp(6px,1.4vw,24px)}

@media (max-width:900px){
  .env2-coll-bands__bandhead{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:6px}
  .env2-coll-bands__facts{font-size:14px}
  .env2-coll-bands__cards{gap:26px 18px}
  .env2-coll-bands__cell{inline-size:100%}
  .env2-coll-bands__cell .env2-pdp-card{inline-size:100%;max-inline-size:100%}
  .env2-coll-bands__body--pair .env2-coll-bands__cards,
  .env2-coll-bands__cards--dip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:18px}
  .env2-coll-bands__fig--scene{block-size:52svh}
  .env2-coll-bands__body--scene .env2-coll-bands__cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);
    margin-block-start:-56px}
  .env2-coll-bands__cards--scene .env2-coll-bands__cell:first-child{grid-column:1;justify-self:stretch}
  .env2-coll-bands__body--scene .env2-pdp-card--scene{--env2-pdp-card-w:100%}
  .env2-coll-bands__body--quote{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px}
  .env2-coll-bands__quote{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;max-inline-size:none}
  .env2-coll-bands__cards--quote{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .env2-coll-bands__widegrid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .env2-coll-bands__fig--wide{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;aspect-ratio:16/9}
  .env2-coll-bands__cards--wide{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;padding-inline-start:0;
    margin-block-start:-40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .env2-coll-bands__pin{inset-inline-start:clamp(23%,var(--env2-pin-x,38%),77%)}
  .env2-coll-bands__pintag{max-inline-size:42vw}
  .env2-coll-bands__pinname{max-inline-size:100%}
  .env2-coll-bands__pinval{font-size:13px}
  .env2-coll-bands__pinstem{block-size:min(var(--env2-pin-stem,110px),74px)}
}

.env2-coll-bands__foot{margin-block-start:clamp(28px,3vw,48px);padding-block-start:20px;
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--env2-hair)}
.env2-coll-bands__assert,.env2-coll-bands__footnote{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);
  font-weight:300;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--env2-mute)}
.env2-coll-bands__footnote{margin-block-start:8px}

/* CREATIVE-03 + §3.6.4 / do-not 10 — no cream, beige or brown on any surface, INCLUDING a photograph
   whose own ground is cream. The veil was scoped to the off-scale and area bands, so wall band 01's
   studio cut-out shipped at mean RGB (218,201,184) with 69% of its pixels above r200/g190/b170 — a
   cream slab on a #070b15 ground — and the same two frames ran 511 and 691px wide on /collections/all,
   the largest pictures on the page. The image ledger cannot answer this: it is shared with the product
   page, whose render is frozen this round. So the veil now covers EVERY card photograph in every band
   (a merchant image can be anything), and it is graded rather than merely multiplied: the sky-4
   multiply kills the warmth and the brightness/saturation trim takes a daylight studio wall down to
   the page's night. A frame that was already night is untouched by construction — multiplying near
   black by a dark blue is still near black.

   The veil is on ::BEFORE, not ::after, and that is the whole reason the old one never worked:
   elmsnest-v2-core owns "[data-lamp] .env2-ph::after" for the warm halo, at the same specificity,
   and later in the cascade — so the veil this section wrote for the off-scale band was silently
   replaced by the core's screen glow and never painted a pixel. Measured on the deployed render
   before this change: wall band 01's right card mean RGB (204,189,173) with 36.7% of its pixels
   above r200/g190/b170, i.e. exactly the cream the critic reported, veil or no veil. ::before keeps
   the core's halo (tree order paints it above) and finally applies the multiply. */
.env2-coll-bands__cards .env2-pdp-card__ph::before{content:"";position:absolute;
  inset:0;background:var(--env2-sky-4);mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.46;pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
.env2-coll-bands__band[data-kind="off"] .env2-pdp-card__ph::before,
.env2-coll-bands__band[data-kind="area"] .env2-pdp-card__ph::before{opacity:.56}

/* core REPORT §9.1 — an anchor styled as the filled pill inherits ink from .env2-section a and lands
   at 1.21:1. The card only ships ghost anchors, but this keeps a future one legible either way. */
.env2-coll-bands a.env2-btn:not(.env2-btn--ghost){color:var(--env2-btn-ink)}
.env2-coll-bands .env2-btn--sm{min-block-size:44px}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .env2-coll-bands__fig img,.env2-coll-bands__pindot,
  .env2-coll-bands__pinstem,.env2-coll-bands__pintag{transition:none}
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% javascript %}
/* elmsnest-v2-coll-bands — there is no behaviour here to lose.
   Every band, every price, every add-to-cart form and every pin is markup, so the walk is complete
   and buyable with this file deleted or with scripting disabled. All this does is hand the section's
   photographs, halos and glyph plates to the shared lamp observer, and light them itself if the core
   bundle is missing — the CONTRACT's closing fallback line. */
(function () {
  function init(el) {
    if (el.__env2CollBands) return;
    el.__env2CollBands = true;
    window.env2 ? env2.observe(el) : el.querySelectorAll('[data-lamp]').forEach(function (l) { l.classList.add('lit'); });
  }
  function boot(root) {
